22:40.040 --> 22:45.800
Assume G is a group,

22:45.920 --> 22:46.820
and A is an element of G,

22:46.940 --> 22:47.980
with the order of A being N.

22:48.160 --> 22:49.660
Let K be a natural number.

22:50.360 --> 22:52.660
Let D be the greatest common divisor of N and K,

22:52.860 --> 22:53.100
