23:23.440 --> 23:25.740
But then, rearranging up by laws of exponents

23:25.740 --> 23:27.160
gives me that A to the power of D

23:27.160 --> 23:28.600
to the power of Z-Y

23:28.600 --> 23:30.680
is an element of

23:30.680 --> 23:34.700
well, that's equal to X,

