but that's also, by definition,

23:37.160 --> 23:38.960
a power of A to the D

23:38.960 --> 23:40.520
which is to say that it's in the subgroup

23:40.520 --> 23:41.160
generated by

23:41.160 --> 23:43.400
A to the power of D

23:43.400 --> 23:44.320
which, of course, is

23:44.320 --> 23:46.080
GCD and NK, right?

